<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price to 8,040 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price to 8,040 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA, a unit of Preussag, said it raised its indicative zinc price to 8,040 francs per tonne on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The last change was to 7,740 francs on February 18.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
